##### MF2: RESONANCE PARAMETERS                                   7231 1451  177
                                                                  7231 1451  178
- MT151    : Resonance parameters                                 7231 1451  179
                                                                  7231 1451  180
Details about the origin of the resonance parameters for this     7231 1451  181
