##### MF3: REACTION CROSS SECTIONS                                7231 1451  185
                                                                  7231 1451  186
All the data present in the following MT-sections have been       7231 1451  187
calculated with TALYS, possibly normalized to experimental data.  7231 1451  188
If the maximal cross section in an excitation function over the   7231 1451  189
whole energy range does not exceed 1.e-9 b, the MT-number is not  7231 1451  190
included. Cross sections lower than 1.e-20 b are assumed to have  7231 1451  191
no physical meaning and are set to zero. All MT numbers extend up 7231 1451  192
to the highest incident energy.                                   7231 1451  193
The following reaction channels/MT numbers are generally included:7231 1451  194
                                                                  7231 1451  195
- MT1      : Total cross section                                  7231 1451  196
                                                                  7231 1451  197
Calculated with the optical model over the whole energy range,    7231 1451  198
or partly reproduced using experimental data.                     7231 1451  199
                                                                  7231 1451  200
- MT2      : Elastic scattering cross section                     7231 1451  201
                                                                  7231 1451  202
Obtained by subtracting the non-elastic cross section from the    7231 1451  203
total cross section.                                              7231 1451  204
                                                                  7231 1451  205
- MT3      : Non-elastic cross section                            7231 1451  206
                                                                  7231 1451  207
Calculated with the optical model over the whole energy range.    7231 1451  208
                                                                  7231 1451  209
- MT4      : Total inelastic cross section                        7231 1451  210
                                                                  7231 1451  211
Sum of MT=51-91.                                                  7231 1451  212
                                                                  7231 1451  213
- MT5      : (n,anything) cross section                           7231 1451  214
                                                                  7231 1451  215
MT5 contains the reactions which can not be stored in any other   7231 1451  216
MT-number. The information of MF3/MT5 can be combined with        7231 1451  217
MF6/MT5 to obtain residual production cross sections particle     7231 1451  218
production cross sections and (double-)differential cross         7231 1451  219
sections.                                                         7231 1451  220
                                                                  7231 1451  221
- MT16     : (n,2n) cross section                                 7231 1451  222
- MT17     : (n,3n) cross section                                 7231 1451  223
- MT22     : (n,na) cross section                                 7231 1451  224
- MT28     : (n,np) cross section                                 7231 1451  225
- MT51-90  : (n,n') cross section for 1st-40th excited state      7231 1451  226
- MT91     : (n,n') continuum cross section                       7231 1451  227
- MT102    : (n,gamma) cross section                              7231 1451  228
- MT103    : (n,p) cross section                                  7231 1451  229
- MT104    : (n,d) cross section                                  7231 1451  230
- MT105    : (n,t) cross section                                  7231 1451  231
- MT106    : (n,h) cross section                                  7231 1451  232
- MT107    : (n,a) cross section                                  7231 1451  233
- MT600-610: (n,p) cross section for 0th-10th excited state       7231 1451  234
- MT649    : (n,p) continuum cross section                        7231 1451  235
- MT650-655: (n,d) cross section for 0th-5th excited state        7231 1451  236
- MT699    : (n,d) continuum cross section                        7231 1451  237
- MT700-705: (n,t) cross section for 0th-5th excited state        7231 1451  238
- MT749    : (n,t) continuum cross section                        7231 1451  239
- MT750-755: (n,h) cross section for 0th-5th excited state        7231 1451  240
- MT799    : (n,h) continuum cross section                        7231 1451  241
- MT800-810: (n,a) cross section for 0th-10th excited state       7231 1451  242
- MT849    : (n,a) continuum cross section                        7231 1451  243
